 "remarks": "A special opportunity awaits at 184 Compo Road South in Westport! Set on just over an acre, this property offers a rare chance to own a generous parcel of land along one of Westport's desirable corridors. The existing 3-bedroom Cape offers a starting point for those with a vision, while the expansive property presents exciting possibilities for builders, investors, or buyers looking to create a home tailored to their own style and needs. The location is truly exceptional, just minutes from Compo Beach, the Westport train station, downtown Westport, and Longshore Club Park, with its golf, tennis, swimming, and waterfront amenities. With sidewalks now in place along Compo Road South, walking and biking to many of Westport's favorite destinations is more convenient than ever. Enjoy the opportunity to bring your vision to life in a sought-after setting, surrounded by the coastal charm, vibrant downtown, and outstanding recreational amenities that make Westport such a special place to call home.  Property is being offered and sold in as-is condition.",
